WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.312
Module 8 moves from query structure to value transformation.

00:00:04.312 --> 00:00:11.027
You will work with text functions, pattern matching, dates, timestamps, and date arithmetic.

00:00:11.027 --> 00:00:16.692
The subquery ideas from this module will continue to be useful because real queries often combine nested logic

00:00:16.692 --> 00:00:20.247
with transformations.

00:00:20.247 --> 00:00:25.097
Before moving on, make sure you can explain what the inner query returns and why the outer operator matches

00:00:25.097 --> 00:00:32.657
that result. As you move forward, keep the reasoning habits from this module.

00:00:32.657 --> 00:00:38.012
The next topic will add new SQL tools, but it still depends on understanding grain, missing values,

00:00:38.012 --> 00:00:41.120
and the meaning of each transformation.
